# Regenerable Gradle/npm artifacts - not useful to track, large, churns
# constantly.
node_modules/
build/
app/build/
.gradle/
*.aab
*.apk
*.apk.idsig

# The actual Play Store signing key. Never belongs in git history, even in
# a private repo - there's no way to "unleak" a signing key after the fact,
# only rotate it (which means losing the ability to update the app under
# its current listing unless Play App Signing is enrolled). Re-run
# generate-project.js to create a fresh one if this is ever lost -
# IMPORTANT: that means a working app build still requires the real key
# backed up separately (password manager), since this .gitignore entry
# means git alone can never restore it.
android.keystore
KEYSTORE_CREDENTIALS_DO_NOT_COMMIT.txt
